exports[`Compliance: the words of every fixed message > UX-AI-10: every template’s subject and text are exactly what they were > checks 1`] = `
"Subject: 12 Ranelagh Road: a few checks before an offer

Hello Aoife,

Thanks for applying for 12 Ranelagh Road, Ranelagh, Dublin 6. Before making an offer, Halcyon Lettings would like to check three things: your ID, your income and your references.

Each check is free, and you start each one yourself, here. We explain each one first:
https://app.gaff.test/r/renter-token

Only Halcyon Lettings sees the results. Once Halcyon Lettings has decided who to offer the home to, we’ll email you either way.

Halcyon Lettings"
`;

exports[`Compliance: the words of every fixed message > UX-AI-10: every template’s subject and text are exactly what they were > first reply 1`] = `
"Subject: Your enquiry about 12 Ranelagh Road

Hello Aoife,

Thanks for your enquiry about 12 Ranelagh Road, Ranelagh, Dublin 6.

I’m Halcyon Lettings’ AI assistant. I’ll help with your enquiry, and a person at Halcyon Lettings makes every decision. If you’d rather talk to a person, just reply and say so.

So we can consider you for a viewing, please answer a few quick questions. It takes about a minute, and you don’t need an account:
https://app.gaff.test/r/renter-token

The rent is €1,850 a month, and the home is available from Tuesday 1 December. Viewings start on Saturday 7 November. If you’re invited, you’ll get a link to book a time that suits you. Either way, you’ll hear back from us.

How we use your details: https://app.gaff.test/privacy/halcyon-lettings

Halcyon Lettings"
`;

