"Subject: An offer: 12 Ranelagh Road

Hello Aoife,

Good news: Halcyon Lettings would like to offer you 12 Ranelagh Road, Ranelagh, Dublin 6.

The rent is €1,850 a month, from Tuesday 1 December. To secure the home, you’d pay a deposit of €1,850 and the first month’s rent of €1,850, directly to Halcyon Lettings. There are no other fees, and nothing is paid through Gaff.

Please accept or decline by Thursday 5 November, 6pm, here:
https://app.gaff.test/r/renter-token

If you accept, Halcyon Lettings will send you the tenancy agreement to sign, and how to pay. If we don’t hear from you by then, the offer closes.

Halcyon Lettings"
`;

